### Framework resolution only (empty sendingCourses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/articulations/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sendingInstitution": {
    "identifiers": [
      { "type": "coci:schoolId", "value": "46" }
    ]
  },
  "receivingInstitution": {
    "identifiers": [
      { "type": "ais:institutionId", "value": "39" }
    ]
  },
  "sendingCourses": []
}

### Unknown institution pair (expect 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/articulations/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sendingInstitution": {
    "identifiers": [
      { "type": "coci:schoolId", "value": "UNKNOWN_SENDING" }
    ]
  },
  "receivingInstitution": {
    "identifiers": [
      { "type": "ais:institutionId", "value": "UNKNOWN_RECEIVING" }
    ]
  },
  "sendingCourses": [
    {
      "identifiers": [
        { "type": "courseCode", "value": "MATH 12" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

